GeminiDepthPort
Copyright 2026 soulteary and contributors.

This project provides community-maintained camera configuration, Web management,
preview, and deployment tooling for Orbbec Gemini 335L and Gemini 2 cameras.
It is not an official Orbbec product and is not endorsed by Orbbec.

Compatibility parameters and launch argument contracts are based on:
  OrbbecSDK_ROS2
  https://github.com/orbbec/OrbbecSDK_ROS2
  Commit: c153462518ad674650bafa4464fda72c27ab797a
  License: Apache License, Version 2.0

The upstream driver is fetched during the camera image build. Its original
copyright, license and applicable notices remain with the upstream components.
Orbbec SDK binaries, extensions and other third-party components are not
relicensed by the GeminiDepthPort Apache-2.0 license.

GeminiDepthPort applies a small, publicly documented modification to the pinned
OrbbecSDK_ROS2 source for owned native YUYV ROS publication and preview saving.
The patch, source hashes and modification description are retained under
patches/public-orbbec/ and docs/native-yuyv.md. Original upstream notices remain.
